Package: orbital-saver
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Suggests: xfce4-screensaver | xscreensaver | mate-screensaver
Homepage: https://github.com/codetheuri/orbital-saver
Description: retro wireframe solar system screensaver for X11
 Polyhedral planets, a ringed world, moons and a comet follow elliptical
 Keplerian orbits around a central star, drawn as depth-faded wireframes
 over a parallax starfield.
 .
 A single static binary with no library dependencies. Works with
 xfce4-screensaver and xscreensaver, or standalone with --preview.
